This package statically links QES-Winds 2.3.1, vendored with modifications in
src/qes_core (see src/qes_core/PROVENANCE.md). Its copyright and license notices
are preserved in src/qes_core/LICENSE and the corresponding source files.
QES-Winds is developed by the University of Utah and University of Minnesota
Duluth; see https://github.com/UtahEFD/QES-Public and the source headers for
attribution.

The original QES CMake/CPack metadata said MIT, conflicting with its GPL-3.0
LICENSE and source notices. This fork corrects the build metadata to match
those authoritative notices. A prepared upstream report is included in
docs/upstream-license-report.md in the source distribution; it has not been
submitted from this checkout.
